type": "RSLT", "id": 11}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le12ob08re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le12ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le12ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le12ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Are you someone who is constantly looking after the needs of others?<br/>\nDo you rarely dedicate time for exercise or regular medical check ups?<br/>\nIt has been often written by health experts that people have to look after themselves if they wish to live long, healthy lives."}, {"time": "16750", "image": "engenn8le12ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "There are a variety of reasons why people may decide against putting themselves first. Some may perceive time outside the family as selfish. Oftentimes, people point to their never ending family responsibilities. Others might find it a challenge to fit time for themselves into their work busy schedule.<br/>Hectic lifestyles have been encouraging us make poor choices. In fact,  the less time you have to plan meals and follow a regular exercise program, the more likely you are to become overwhelmed and exhausted."}, {"time": "48500", "image": "engenn8le12ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "There are a number of things people must do to increase their longevity.  These include increasing their cardiovascular fitness, ensuring that they are getting the recommended amount of sleep, monitoring their dietary intake and practicing forms of relaxation.  In a world where the stress of daily living can take a toll, going for a brisk walk, going to a yoga class in the park or learning new healthy recipes can enhance our overall well-being. In addition, there are many health blogs and websites that have been created to provide tips and ideas for healthy living. Furthermore, health recommendations are provided on these sites as well. Carve out some time yourself - you deserve it."}]}}], "id": 1}, {"type": "video", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "12000", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> What is the purpose of an argumentative text?</span>"}, {"time": "48000", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">  What are different words you can use in an argumentative text?</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn8le12ob08re3vid01"}}], "id": 2}]}], "type": "sena"}